             "accessibility_label": null,
             "bindings": null,
             "aggregate_bindings": null
            }
           },
           {
            "type": "MARKDOWN_TEXT",
            "content": {
             "text": "One Rep Max measures the maximum weight you can lift for a single repetition of an exercise and is a widely used indicator of strength. It also unlocks intensity—the weight you lift relative to your One Rep Max.",
             "style": "B1",
             "color": "WHITE_70",
             "alignment": "LEADING",
             "icon": null,
             "icon_position": null,
             "max_lines": null,
             "min_lines": null,
             "fill_width": true,
             "accessibility_label": null,
             "bindings": null,
             "aggregate_bindings": null
            }
           },
           {
            "type": "MARKDOWN_TEXT",
            "content": {
             "text": "WHOOP estimates your One Rep Max for eligible weight-based exercises using weight lifted, reps completed, manual entries, and training history. Estimates are most accurate when training close to failure. To unlock your One Rep Max, log an exercise for 12 reps or fewer.",
             "style": "B1",
             "color": "WHITE_70",
             "alignment": "LEADING",
             "icon": null,
             "icon_position": null,
             "max_lines": null,
             "min_lines": null,
             "fill_width": true,
             "accessibility_label": null,
             "bindings": null,
             "aggregate_bindings": null
            }
           },
           {
            "type": "MARKDOWN_TEXT",
            "content": {
             "text": "One Rep Max updates gradually with consistent training. To account for any changes in strength, log exercises again if it’s been over four weeks since your last estimate.",
             "style": "B1",
             "color": "WHITE_70",
             "alignment": "LEADING",
             "icon": null,
             "icon_position": null,
             "max_lines": null,
             "min_lines": null,
             "fill_width": true,
             "accessibility_label": null,
             "bindings": null,
